request.description:
Amount ending in 13 makes the paypal mock SoftDecline. Routing falls over to stripe, which Captures. THIS is intelligent routing — the merchant never sees the soft decline; the platform's job is to find a provider that says yes.
Expected: 201, status="Captured", providerCode="stripe", AND attempts.length == 2:
  attempts[0] = { paypal, SoftDeclined, INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS }
  attempts[1] = { stripe, Captured }
